      "text": "Hyperideal polyhedra in hyperbolic 3-space — — A hyperideal polyhedron is a non-compact polyhedron in the hyperbolic 3-space 3 which, in the projective model for 3 ⊂ 3, is just the intersection of 3\n\n**Hyperideal polyhedra in hyperbolic 3-space**\n\n35 pp, 10 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** — A hyperideal polyhedron is a non-compact polyhedron in the hyperbolic 3-space 3 which, in the projective model for 3 ⊂ 3, is just the intersection of 3 with a projective polyhedron whose vertices are all outside 3 and whose edges all meet 3 . We classify hyperideal polyhedra, up to isometries of 3, in terms of their combinatorial type and of their dihedral angles. R´esum´e (Poly`edres hyperid´eaux de l’espace hyperbolique de dimension 3) Un poly`edre hyperid´eal est un poly`edre non-compact de l’espace hyperbolique 3 de dimension 3 qui, dans le mod`ele projectif pour 3 ⊂ 3, est simplement l’intersection de 3 avec un poly`edre projectif dont les sommets sont tous en dehors de 3 et dont toutes les arˆetes rencontrent 3. Nous classiﬁons ces poly`edres hyperid´eaux, `a isom´etrie de 3 pr`es, en fonction de leur type combinatoire et de leurs angles di´edraux.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; P Proj is located on the sphere at inﬁnity ∂∞H; 1 Hyperideal polyhedra; P Proj associated to the hyperideal polyhedron; 2 Necessary conditions; 3 Spaces of polyhedra; 4 The Inﬁnitesimal Rigidity Lemma; 5 Convergence of hyperideal polyhedra; 6 Realizing large angles; 7 Proof of Theorems 1 and 2",
